      "body": "`Dispatcher` implements `ILoggerProvider` and maintains a `ConcurrentDictionary<long, CallContext>` of active contexts keyed by `CorrelationId.BaseId`. `DispatcherLogger` (created by the provider) extracts correlation IDs from log scopes, looks up the `CallContext`, and enriches structured log entries with decomposed fields: `correlationId`, `correlationBaseId`, `correlationStep`, `operationName`, `userId`, `roles`, `elapsed`. `CallContext` implements `ILogger` and captures log entries to an internal list.\n\n**Covered by:** `Dispatcher`, `DispatcherLogger`, `CallContext`",
